{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月19日，據《紐約時報》報道，當地時間周三上午，英偉達臨時CEO科萊特·克雷斯（Colette Kress）在加州聖克拉拉總部主持了一場全員大會，試圖安撫因聯合創始人黃仁勳突然離職而陷入不安的員工。這是克雷斯接任臨時CEO僅六天後舉行的一次重要內部會議。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587040.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:24:10.864331+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:12:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.541114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.541114+00:00","content_hash":"f985b047368557de4c9d99010e8325567f0bf034685fcb7490892452d78a8aa4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}